{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} — appointments, questions, and VIP Day bookings for aromatherapy experiences.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg-1:#F7F9F6;
      --bg-2:#EEF6F2;
      --accent:#6AAE87;
      --muted:#6B7280;
      --card:#FFFFFF;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(11,15,10,0.06);
      --radius:14px;
      --maxw:1100px;
      --accent-dark:#4A8A65;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{
      margin:0;
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg-1),var(--bg-2));
      color:#0b0e0a;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      line-height:1.45;
    }
    header{position:relative;padding:28px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .nav{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px}
    .brand{flex:0 0 auto;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.2px}
    nav{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    a.nav-link{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px}
    a.nav-link:hover{background:rgba(74,138,101,0.08);color:var(--accent-dark)}
    .container{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:28px;position:relative}

    /* HERO */
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center;padding:36px;border-radius:16px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(255,255,255,0.45));box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .hero-inner{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted);max-width:64ch}
    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:white}
    .btn-ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(11,15,10,0.06);color:var(--muted)}

    /* two column layout for contact block */
    .split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:20px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}

    form label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    form input, form textarea, form select{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,15,10,0.06);border-radius:8px;background:transparent}
    form textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}

    /* sections */
    section{margin-top:22px}
    h2{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:20px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}

    /* schedule grid */
    .times{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
    .time{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f8fdf8);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(74,138,101,0.06);font-weight:600}

    /* pricing */
    .pricing-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:12px}
    .price{padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(106,174,135,0.06),rgba(255,255,255,0.6));}
    .price h3{margin:0;font-size:16px}
    .price p{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* faq */
    .faq-item{margin-bottom:12px}
    .question{font-weight:700}

    footer{padding:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* decorative SVG pattern */
    .pattern-wrap{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden;border-radius:16px}
    .pattern-svg{position:absolute;right:-10%;top:-10%;width:60%;height:120%;opacity:0.12;transform:rotate(8deg)}

    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:880px){
      .split{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .hero{padding:20px}
      h1{font-size:22px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/index.html">Home</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/blends.html">Blends</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/shop.html">Shop</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/pricing.html">Invest</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/about.html">About</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/book.html">Schedule</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero card" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="pattern-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
        <!-- inline unique SVG pattern; also keep assets/img/pattern.svg as canonical external asset -->
        <svg class="pattern-svg" viewBox="0 0 600 600" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMinYMin slice">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#8AD6B0" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#6AAE87" stop-opacity="0.8"/>
            </linearGradient>
            <pattern id="p1" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
              <rect width="20" height="20" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.06)"/>
              <circle cx="30" cy="10" r="4" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)"/>
            </pattern>
            <filter id="soft" x="-10%" y="-10%" width="120%" height="120%">
              <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="8" result="b"/>
              <feBlend in="SourceGraphic" in2="b" mode="normal"/>
            </filter>
          </defs>
          <rect width="600" height="600" fill="url(#g1)" opacity="0.18" filter="url(#soft)"/>
          <rect width="600" height="600" fill="url(#p1)" opacity="0.35"/>
          <g opacity="0.5" fill="#fff">
            <path d="M120 420c40-120 220-120 260 0" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity="0.06" stroke-width="40" fill="none"/>
            <circle cx="480" cy="120" r="70" fill="#fff" opacity="0.04"/>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div>
          <h1 id="hero-title">Let's find the right aromatic ritual for you</h1>
          <p class="lead">Reach out to schedule a consultation, ask about blends, or book a focused VIP Day. {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} offers tailored aromatherapy sessions that respect safety and individual needs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#contact-form">Message the studio</a>
          <a class="btn" style="background:transparent;color:var(--muted)" href="tel:{{PHONE}}">Call: {{PHONE}}</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <section aria-labelledby="ritual-title">
            <h2 id="ritual-title">A brief note on rituals & safety</h2>
            <p class="muted">Aromatherapy at {{BUSINESS_NAME}} emphasizes safety-first practices: appropriate dilution, patch testing, and choosing blends with consideration for pets, pregnancy, medications, and sensitivity. We do not provide medical diagnosis or promise clinical outcomes — sessions support wellbeing through scent awareness, careful ingredient selection, and practitioner guidance.</p>
          </section>

          <section aria-labelledby="what-title">
            <h2 id="what-title">What to expect in a consultation</h2>
            <ul class="muted">
              <li>A short intake: preferences, scent history, and safety notes.</li>
              <li>Discussion of desired atmosphere and practical goals (sleep support, calming ritual, daily refresh).</li>
              <li>Demonstration of blends and guidance on safe home use, storage, and dilution ratios.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section aria-labelledby="schedule-title">
            <h2 id="schedule-title">Typical available times</h2>
            <div class="times">
              <div class="time">Mon — 10:00–15:00</div>
              <div class="time">Tue — 12:00–18:00</div>
              <div class="time">Wed — 09:00–13:00</div>
              <div class="time">Thu — 11:00–16:00</div>
              <div class="time">Fri — 10:00–14:00</div>
              <div class="time">VIP Days — select Fridays</div>
            </div>
            <p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">To hold a slot or request evening/weekend options, please get in touch — custom bookings available.</p>
          </section>

        </div>

        <aside>
          <div class="card" aria-labelledby="contact-form">
            <h3 id="contact-form">Message {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</h3>
            <form action="/thank-you.html" method="post" novalidate>
              <label for="name">Your name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" required placeholder="First & last" />

              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" />

              <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="(555) 555-5555" />

              <label for="interest">I am interested in</label>
              <select id="interest" name="interest">
                <option>Consultation (30–60min)</option>
                <option>Blends & custom blend</option>
                <option>VIP Day — focused session</option>
                <option>Wholesale / retail orders</option>
              </select>

              <label for="message">Short note / questions</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell me about sensitivities, pets in the home, or what you're hoping for..."></textarea>

              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
                <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send message</button>
                <a class="btn" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">Email: {{EMAIL}}</a>
              </div>
            </form>

            <hr style="margin:12px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(11,15,10,0.04)" />
            <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">
              <strong>Studio</strong>
              <div>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
              <div style="margin-top:6px">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="pricing-title">
      <h2 id="pricing-title">Pricing highlights & VIP Day</h2>
      <p class="muted">Transparent pricing for common offerings. Custom quotes available for extended sessions and group workshops.</p>
      <div class="pricing-cards" style="margin-top:12px">
        <div class="price card">
          <h3>Consultation — 45 min</h3>
          <p class="muted">$95 — intake, scent exploration, home use guidance</p>
        </div>
        <div class="price card">
          <h3>Custom Blend</h3>
          <p class="muted">$45 + cost of oils — personalized blend with dilution recommendations</p>
        </div>
        <div class="price card">
          <h3>VIP Day — immersive</h3>
          <p class="muted">$950 — dedicated 4–6 hour day: deep consultation, multiple blends, ritual design, take-home kit. Ideal for concentrated transformation and learning.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <h2 id="faq-title">Frequently asked safety questions</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="question">How should I dilute essential oils?</div>
        <div class="muted">Dilution depends on age, sensitivity, and intended use. Typical topical dilutions: adults 1–3% for short-term use; for children or sensitive skin practitioners recommend lower concentrations or aromatherapy via diffusion. Your practitioner will advise a safe ratio for your context.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="question">What is a patch test?</div>
        <div class="muted">A patch test applies a diluted drop of a blend to a small area of skin to check for irritation over 24–48 hours. We always recommend patch testing for new blends if you plan to apply them topically.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="question">Are essential oils safe around pets?</div>
        <div class="muted">Some oils can affect animals. We avoid recommending direct topical application for pets and will suggest pet-safe alternatives and diffusion practices that minimize exposure. Always mention household pets during intake.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="question">What about pregnancy or medication interactions?</div>
        <div class="muted">Pregnancy and certain medications require special precautions. We do not provide medical advice; we will defer and suggest consultation with your healthcare provider when needed, and will propose pregnancy-safe approaches when appropriate.</div>
      </div>

    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="final-cta">
      <h2 id="final-cta">Ready to book a focused session?</h2>
      <p class="muted">For VIP Day requests or to reserve a consultation, select the primary booking link or send a direct message. We'll respond within 48 hours.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:10px">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Book now — {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <a class="btn" href="#contact-form">Send a message</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</div>
    <div style="margin-top:6px">Questions? <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk 4 — contact.html

This bundle contains the contact page and a short README for the aromatherapy site.

Files included:
- contact.html — the Connect / Contact page for the site. Contains the required section pack: hero, ritual, what_to_expect, schedule, pricing, faq, cta. Also includes an inline decorative SVG pattern to ensure visual richness even if external assets are not present.

Placeholders you should replace in templates (keep curly braces):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}
- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}
- {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}

Notes for integration:
- Navigation links point to the site pages: index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html.
- The page avoids medical claims and frames aromatherapy as supportive, safety-first practice. FAQ covers dilution, patch testing, pets, and pregnancy notes.
- Visuals rely on CSS gradients and an inline SVG pattern. There is also an expectation that an external assets/img/pattern.svg may exist in other chunks — the inline SVG provides a fallback and a unique pattern for this page.
- The form is a static POST to /thank-you.html; if you implement a server or form handler, update the action attribute accordingly.

Accessibility & responsive:
- Landmark elements (header, main, footer) and section headings are included for screen readers.
- Layout collapses to a single column on narrow viewports.

Developer tips:
- To customize brand colors, edit the :root variables at the top of the <style> block.
- To add analytics or server-side handling, safely insert scripts before </body>.

If you need the complementary assets (SVG file, fonts, or additional pages) for the full site, request the next chunk to receive them."}
BUNDLE_END
